{"repositoryId":1091812821,"availability":"available","full":"cuihairu/apollo","name":"apollo","description":"C++20 multiplayer game server engine with World processes and temporary group-created instances.","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2025-11-07T14:58:30Z","updated":"2026-10-19T05:50:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","topics":["cpp20","game-engine","game-server","instance-based","mmo","multiplayer","pve","pvp","tower-defense"],"demo":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.146Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.146Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.146Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:30.244Z","stars":3,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-18T19:18:18.894Z","stars":3,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.146Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight instance-based multiplayer game server engine.","Lightweight instance-based multiplayer game server engine","Apollo is a C++20 server runtime for lightweight multiplayer games organized around instances and matches, such as tower defense, co-op, PvE/PvP, arenas, and dungeons. It currently delivers lightweight instances while reserving future seamless Space/Cell, authority, and visibility boundaries."],"features":["Minimalist constructor-injection DI - apollo::core::di: type-keyed bean graph, topologically ordered assembly, ApplicationHost frame-driven lifecycle","Entity contract system - XML+XSD contracts + standalone generator apollogen; the generator is not in the runtime link graph","Async networking - non-blocking sockets + select()/epoll event loop (Windows polls via select(); no IOCP)","Transport codec (target state) - protobuf reflection as default + zstd (planned); the current implementation uses hand-written encoding","AOI 3×3 grid - SceneAoi single implementation + ViewerState per-observer watermarks; the event surface is delivered"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihairu/apollo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3c5a67d0828b3d2e37cb0c857ef734d16813f2e7f4459d439bed87002ad355b0","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.286Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.286Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight instance-based multiplayer game server engine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihairu/apollo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login authentication (AuthManager, available)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihairu/apollo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3c5a67d0828b3d2e37cb0c857ef734d16813f2e7f4459d439bed87002ad355b0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihairu/apollo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.287Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T05:50:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihairu/apollo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.288Z","hash":"3c5a67d0828b3d2e37cb0c857ef734d16813f2e7f4459d439bed87002ad355b0","originalBytes":23781,"storedBytes":23781,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:21.146Z","subjects":["Games & game development"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":["Games & game development"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Games & game development","source":"metadata","match":"game"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Simulation & physics"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T06:37:45.117Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:37:45.117Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T06:37:45.117Z","target":"https://cuihairu.github.io/apollo/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-26T06:37:45.117Z"